{"4867840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TRONADO", "steam_appid": 4867840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867840/extras/8e8b804d69303df8b640db4065dd7ceb.avif?t=1785485847\" width=295 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRONADO is a Sunday afternoon gone wrong: <strong>1-2 parents </strong>versus <strong>3-8 kids.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kids</strong> cause mischief to fill the CHAOS gauge: jump on the couch, scribble on walls, mess with things you shouldn't. Get caught red-handed and it's corner time. Mash to break free, hide in the laundry basket but hold your breath: <strong>your voice carries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-10 players</strong> online and <strong>couch split-screen</strong>, even at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric</strong>: two ways to play, a hundred ways to snap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, frantic rounds</strong>: chaos, patience, chores three gauges, one winning side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red-handed busts</strong>: dad learns to read the house by ear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller or keyboard</strong>, pick-up-and-play in 5 seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No monetization</strong>: one price, the whole game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867840/extras/f2d2dc2d5c53adeadfe1f53e21eb99f2.avif?t=1785485847\" width=163 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is only the beginning. Next stop already in the works: <strong>THE SUPERMARKET </strong>dad does the groceries, kids turn the aisles into a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wishlist TRONADO and warn your dad.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867840/extras/8e8b804d69303df8b640db4065dd7ceb.avif?t=1785485847\" width=295 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TRONADO is a Sunday afternoon gone wrong: <strong>1-2 parents </strong>versus <strong>3-8 kids.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kids</strong> cause mischief to fill the CHAOS gauge: jump on the couch, scribble on walls, mess with things you shouldn't. Get caught red-handed and it's corner time. Mash to break free, hide in the laundry basket but hold your breath: <strong>your voice carries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-10 players</strong> online and <strong>couch split-screen</strong>, even at the same time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric</strong>: two ways to play, a hundred ways to snap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, frantic rounds</strong>: chaos, patience, chores three gauges, one winning side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red-handed busts</strong>: dad learns to read the house by ear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller or keyboard</strong>, pick-up-and-play in 5 seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No monetization</strong>: one price, the whole game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867840/extras/f2d2dc2d5c53adeadfe1f53e21eb99f2.avif?t=1785485847\" width=163 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is only the beginning. Next stop already in the works: <strong>THE SUPERMARKET </strong>dad does the groceries, kids turn the aisles into a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wishlist TRONADO and warn your dad.</i></p>", "short_description": "One dad. A pack of kids. One house to wreck. TRONADO is an asymmetric online party game (2-10 players): kids cause chaos, dad tries to finish his chores without losing it. Hide-and-seek, red-handed busts and proximity voice chat. Who snaps first?", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867840/ed751f8db5ab74fff57426e44fbf654e67f1069d/header.jpg?t=1785485847", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867840/b77fa10121537459a0ea98b5061a55f3c2fdadd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785485847", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4867840/b77fa10121537459a0ea98b5061a55f3c2fdadd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785485847", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (v1909+)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 2600 / Intel i5-8400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6 Go / RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 3600 / Intel i5-10400<br></li><li><strong>Memor